    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "\nGood poetry ensures its form mirrors its ideas, which in turn mirrors its sound. Go back to your annotations. "
        },
        {
          "text": "Where can you add annotations about form (i.e., how it’s visually arranged on the page), ideas (i.e., the ideas Hughes might be trying to convey), and sound (i.e., how it sounds out loud when Hughes reads it) as you listen to the poem again?",
